Rait Zara Si Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie Atrangi Re sung by Arijit Singh & Sasha Tirupati.

Strumming Pattern:

[D]Hona Te [G]ra [A]Hona,        [D]Paana Tum [G]ko [A]Paana
[Bm]Jeena Hai Ye Maana,        [D]Pal Bhar Mein Sadiy [A]an
[D]Hai Sadiyon Mein,        [Bm]Jeena Hai Ye [G]Maana
[F#m]Haath Mein Teri [Bm]Khushboo Hai,        [F#m]Khushboo Se Dil [Bm]Behla Hai

[F#m]Ye Haathon Se [Bm]Yun Fisla Hai,        [Em]Ho Jaise Rait Za [G]ra [A]Si
[F#m]Roj Mohabbat [Bm]Padhta Hai,        [F#m]Dil Ye Tum Se [Bm]Judta Hai
[F#m]Hawaon Mein Yun [Bm]Udta Hai,        [Em]Ho Jaise Rait Zara Si

[A] [F#m] [G] [A]
[D] [D] [D] [D]
[Bm] [A] [D]

<!-- Post Middle -->

[D]Ye Hulchul Dil Ki Ye Hulchul,        Bole [G]Aaj Aas Paas Tu [Bm]Mere
[Bm]Bikhra Hu Main To,        [G]Kuch Pal Hawa Mein
[D]Tere Bharose Ko [A]Thamein,        [A]Chalna Bhi Hai Badalna Bhi [Em]Hai
[Em]Tujhmein Hi [Bm]To Dhal [Em]na Bhi Hai [D]

[F#m]Dil Thoda Jaz [Bm]baati Hai,        [F#m]Bhar Jata Hai [Bm]Baaton Se
[F#m]Ye Fir Chhalke Yun [Bm]Aankho Se,        Ho [Em]Jaise Rait Zar [G]a Si
[F#m]Haath Mein Teri Kh [Em]ushboo [Bm]Hai,        [F#m]Sach Poocho To [Bm]Ab Yun Hai
[F#m]Tu Chehre Pe [Bm]Mere Thehra,        [Em]Ho Jaise Ret [G]Zara [A]Si

